From a2a996ae50d802878bf48e4bbf3730004bdcc55c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] yance module: add official LiveKit Presence workspace

Replay target: pinned Element Web v1.12.25 after
0001-yance-global-right-workspace.patch and after the pre-Presence
integration/element-module overlay has been copied to modules/yance.

This patch changes only the Yance module overlay. Element remains the shell,
livekit-client remains the browser/WebRTC client authority, and CyberVerse
remains the avatar/lip-sync/token authority. Presence teardown closes both the
LiveKit client room and the CyberVerse session on disconnect, connection
failure, and React workspace teardown.
